y predicted behavior under controlled transformations.\",\"Executable, rule-based, source-grounded, human, and automated semantic oracles form a scoring hierarchy.\",\"Independent blinded raters, randomized response order, adjudication, and inter-rater reliability address scoring uncertainty.\",\"A version-controlled harness preserves request bytes, configuration, service metadata, outputs, and oracle versions.\"]}"
